===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|it|passacaglia|notext=1}}, from {{der|en|es|pasear||to walk}} + {{m|es|calle||street}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|music}} A form of historical [[Spanish]] or [[Italian]] dance characterised by a serious nature, [[triple metre]], and use of a [[ground bass]].
# {{lb|en|music}} Any piece of [[classical music]] with similar characteristics.

